1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,040
Who paid for Tony's dinner?
谁为托尼的晚饭付了钱？

2
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,590
Who paid for Tony's dinner?
谁为托尼的晚饭付了钱？

3
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:24,040
I was having dinner at a restaurant when Tony Steele came in.
我正在一家饭馆吃饭，托尼·斯蒂尔走了进来。

4
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:28,510
Tony worked in a lawyer's office years ago,
托尼曾在一家律师事务所工作，

5
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:31,570
but he is now working at a bank.
而现在正在一家银行上班。

6
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:34,550
He gets a good salary,
他的薪水很高，

7
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:40,450
but he always borrows money from his friends and never pays it back.
但他却总是向朋友借钱，并且从来不还。

8
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:46,050
Tony saw me and came and sat at the same table.
托尼看见了我，就走过来和我坐到同一张桌子前。

9
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,590
He has never borrowed money from me.
他从未向我借过钱。

10
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,170
While he was eating,
当他吃饭时，

11
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:55,880
I asked him to lend me twenty pounds.
我提出向他借20英镑。

12
00:00:57,670 --> 00:01:01,740
To my surprise, he gave me the money immediately.
令我惊奇的是，他立刻把钱给了我。

13
00:01:04,530 --> 00:01:07,040
'I have never borrowed any money from you,'
“我还从来没有向你借过钱，”

14
00:01:07,190 --> 00:01:11,100
Tony said, 'so now you can pay for my dinner!'
托尼说道，“所以现在你可以替我付饭钱了！”
